{
  "name": "Advanced Webhook",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚀 Advanced Webhook — Scaled Event-Driven Ticket Triage (NoéMI Accelerator 3)\n- **1. Batch Handling:** `Webhook` (`POST /webhook/practitioner-advanced`) + `Split Batch` unpacks incoming event bursts (`body.events` array).\n- **2. Data Cleaning & Validation:** `Clean & Normalize Data` trims/normalizes fields (`ticket_id`, `customer_name`, `priority`) before `Validate Data` filters incomplete items to `Log Invalid Item`.\n- **3. External API & Resilience (`resilience_helpers.js`):** `External API (Enrich)` calls external enrichment with exponential backoff retry (`maxTries: 3`) + `continueOnFail` error routing to `Log API Error`.\n- **4. Multi-Destination Fan-out:** Valid enriched items are formatted in `Clean Data` and dispatched in parallel to `Dest 1: DB Log` and `Dest 2: Email API`.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 1480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e1000001-1111-4111-8111-000000000001",
      "name": "Architecture Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1136,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "practitioner-advanced",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "49ebe9db-7dff-48ce-a11f-8ab0004d9caa",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1136,
        496
      ],
      "webhookId": "580a0248-cc3c-4bc7-a595-3592ab9b386b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "body.events",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "04c624c0-e2a1-423c-919c-2a05f31964e9",
      "name": "Split Batch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.itemLists",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -944,
        496
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.item.json;\nconst clean = (val) => (typeof val === 'string' ? val.replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim() : '');\n\nconst ticket_id = clean(raw.ticket_id).toUpperCase();\nconst customer_name = clean(raw.customer_name || raw.customer) || 'Unknown Customer';\nconst rawPriority = clean(raw.priority).toLowerCase();\nconst priority = ['high', 'medium', 'low', 'critical'].includes(rawPriority) ? rawPriority : 'normal';\nconst simulate_error = Boolean(raw.simulate_error);\n\nconst missing_fields = [];\nif (!ticket_id) missing_fields.push('ticket_id');\nif (!clean(raw.customer_name || raw.customer)) missing_fields.push('customer_name');\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ticket_id,\n    customer_name,\n    priority,\n    simulate_error,\n    is_valid: missing_fields.length === 0,\n    missing_fields,\n    cleaned_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "b72e1102-3a91-4c22-9100-112233445566",
      "name": "Clean & Normalize Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -752,
        496
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.ticket_id}}",
              "operation": "isNotEmpty"
            },
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.customer_name}}",
              "operation": "notEqual",
              "value2": "Unknown Customer"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "177e0b09-e3b5-40af-b1f2-9efb9e4e9621",
      "name": "Validate Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        496
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "keepOnlySet": true,
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "ErrorReason",
              "value": "=Validation Failed: Missing required fields ({{ ($json.missing_fields || ['ticket_id']).join(', ') }})"
            },
            {
              "name": "Status",
              "value": "REJECTED_INVALID_PAYLOAD"
            },
            {
              "name": "RawData",
              "value": "={{JSON.stringify($json)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "47b59ba5-42e9-4899-83e8-51e9cfc6d32c",
      "name": "Log Invalid Item",
